    "quote": "Report a death, serious injury, fire, or suspected thermal runaway within 24 hours of becoming aware; report other thermal incidents within 5 business days. Manufacturers must notify affected customers promptly when an incident indicates a hazard that could affect their unit, with immediate notice for an urgent risk and otherwise within 5 business days."
